        "alt": "型抜きに指先だけで挑む、成功直前の静寂"
      }
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.peony.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "main.s1.eve.peony.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.peony.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.peony.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.peony.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "前夜祭を、ピオニーと回ることになった。彼女は集合場所に、そうっと、そうっと歩いてきた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.peony.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.peony.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "慎重に。——石畳が、一歩ごとに、みしっと沈んだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.peony.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.peony.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "慎重になるほど壊れるのは、チームの全員が知っている。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.peony.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.peony.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「今夜は、なにも壊さない」と、彼女は宣言した。耳が、思わず、ぴくっと引いた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.peony.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.peony.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "宣言した手が、緊張で夜店の柱を掴み、柱が飴のように曲がった。屋台のおやじは動じなかった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.peony.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.peony.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「うちは補強済みだ。祭りだからな」この街の祭り、備えが厚い。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.peony.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.peony.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "型抜きの屋台の前で、彼女の足が止まった。薄い砂糖菓子を、針で削る遊び。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.peony.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.peony.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……この世でいちばん、彼女に向いていない遊びだ。目が、本気だった。「やる」",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.peony.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "main.s1.eve.peony.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.peony.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.peony.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "一枚目、粉になった。二枚目、粉になった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.peony.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.peony.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "三枚目——彼女は息を止め、指先だけの力で、針を動かした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.peony.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.peony.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "周りに人垣ができ、誰も声を出さない。祭りの喧騒の真ん中に、小さな静けさの島ができていた。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.peony.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.peony.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "抜けた——花の形のまま、欠けずに。人垣が、わっと沸いた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.peony.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.peony.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "彼女は、型抜きの花を両手に載せて、宝物みたいに見つめていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.peony.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.peony.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「……壊さなかった」壊しませんでした。ちゃんと、見てました。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.peony.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.peony.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "帰り道、彼女は型抜きの花をくれた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.peony.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.peony.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「明日、全力を出す。全力の私は、たぶん、いろいろ壊す。……でも」彼女は自分の手を見た。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.peony.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.peony.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「壊さない力も、あるって、今日わかった」",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.peony.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.peony.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "型抜きの花は、手帳のいちばん厚い頁に、そっと挟んだ。押し花ならぬ、押し砂糖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.peony.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.eve.peony.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "明日の決勝で何が壊れても、これだけは、壊れない場所にある。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.peony.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s1.eve.peony.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
